Descriptor CalendarEvent
    documentation 'This descriptor holds the types of scheduled or unscheduled event for the day 
                  '(e.g., Instructional day, Teacher only day, Holiday, Make-up day, Weather day, 
                  'Student late arrival/early dismissal day).
    with map type
        item Instructional day
        item Teacher only day
        item Holiday
        item Make-up day
        item Weather day
        item Student late arrival/early dismissal
        item Emergency day
        item Strike
        item Other